 ## Context
 
-The smoke-test CLI in `tools/orchestration` waits a hard-coded 30 s for the assistant's reply. This design makes that wait configurable via a `--timeout <seconds>` flag and an `OPENCODE_REPLY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` environment default, keeping 30 s as the default, honoring the value inside `runPrompt`, and reporting the elapsed timeout clearly. Source document: `docs/prompts/add-timeout-flag.md`; supporting research: `docs/designs/002-add-timeout-flag/01-research.md`. The change stays inside `tools/orchestration` and existing tests must stay green.
